# Per-Dockerfile ignore file. BuildKit looks for `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore`
# before falling back to `.dockerignore` at the context root -- and the root file
# demonstrably was NOT applied to this build (the published image contained
# /app/.dockerignore itself, alongside every directory that file excludes).
#
# The Dockerfile's COPY steps are an explicit allowlist, so this is defence in
# depth rather than the primary control. The one entry that is load-bearing is
# node_modules: `COPY packages ./packages` from a dirty local tree would
# otherwise overwrite pnpm's workspace symlinks with a host node_modules tree.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
docs
e2e
charts
.github
.claude
scripts
*.log
.env
.env.*
